WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.634
Key two: your phone. Your everyday key.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:05.524
Lost it?

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.073
Got your backup? Restore it on a new phone. No waiting.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.766
No backup? Your hardware wallet and your guardian start a recovery.

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.806
It waits seven days, and alerts you and your contacts every day.

6
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.700
Stolen?

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.562
They can spend at most your daily limit. Raising it needs your hardware wallet.

8
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.964
Start a recovery, and phone-only payments pause.

9
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.065
One key gone. Your bitcoin isn't.
